      "value": "@{5b2821f1443b6a55287c67ad|full_name}: Alright, I did a little more testing and this is what I observed about the issue:\n1. Once the issue arose nothing seems to help fixing it except from factory resetting the steam deck - tried installing/reinstalling VRChat, checking integrity of local files, even manually finding the AppData VRChat folder on SteamOS and deleting it - nothing. Output logs in AppData folder had nothing unusual compared to output logs when VRChat was working before.\n2. While the issue was in effect VRChat seems to show standard keyboard control mapping icons in game instead of controller ones - V to voice chat instead of Y, space to jump, left mouse button to pick up objects, etc.\nI've factory reset my Steam Deck and the issue seems to be gone for now. Tried to do the same steps as I did at first to replicate the issue, but it didn't arise like switching to open beta before installing VRChat, switching to open beta while VRChat was already installed and on stable build.",
